                                                "sense_id": "9f03640d-4ef2-36d8-87f6-a397aba6b384",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, Bishop questioned whether the increase in lesbians now considering motherhood is a response to pressure to have childen in order to see ourselves as whole and healthy. She noted the strong tide of pro-natalism sweeping our country; for example, the current preponderance of movies about babies."
