                                                "sense_id": "9f03640d-4ef2-36d8-87f6-a397aba6b384",
                                                "text": "In France the emphasis fell on pronatalism; after the crushing defeat in the Franco-Prussian War of 1870–1 and with the French population being outstripped by the German, health propaganda encouraged large families."
